WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.835 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Guys, there's so much
going on right now.

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:04.137
Today, the President of
the United States was impeached.

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:06.406 align:start size:94% position:6%
Over in Russia,
Vladimir Putin is about to hav

00:00:06.406 --> 00:00:08.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
his big year-end
press conference.

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:11.011 size:78% position:39%
The movie "Star Wars:
Rise of Skywalker"

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:11.878 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
comes out tomorrow.

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:15.248
And a man at a Nashville airport
got busted with 84 pounds

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:18.952 align:start size:94% position:6%
of weed wrapped
like Christmas presents.

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:19.652 line:92%
There's a lot to go over.

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:21.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let's just jump in
and cover it all at once.

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.089 line:92%
It's time for a "News Smash.

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:26.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:26.393 --> 00:00:28.194 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Ding ]

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.930 size:84% position:42%
-First, President Trump
got impeached today,

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.132 line:92%
and he's not happy about it.

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:34.701
He wrote an angry letter,
sent hundreds of tweets,

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.703 line:92%
and shouted at his staff.

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:38.605 size:81% position:41% line:92%
He needs to chill out.

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:40.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you know what's great
for chilling out?

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:42.609 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Christmas weed.

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:45.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
84 pounds of it was found
wrapped like presents

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:47.647 line:92%
at the airport in Nashville.

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:51.084 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's enough weed
to get you really high.

00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:52.886 line:92%
So high that you end up in

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.355 size:84% position:42% line:92%
a galaxy far, far away.

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:57.123
The new "Star Wars" movie
hits theaters tomorrow,

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:59.459 align:start size:94% position:6%
and there are so many question
left to be answered.

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:01.728 size:75% position:38%
Will Luke come back?
Will Kylo Ren win?

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:06.733
Will Rey change course and cross
over to the dark side?

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:09.769
Tomorrow, Putin is holding
his annual press conference,

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:11.805 align:start size:94% position:6%
where he talks to reporter
for hours.

00:01:11.805 --> 00:01:13.540 align:start size:94% position:6%
But no matter what
he does or says,

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:16.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
there's no way
he'll ever be impeached.

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:18.144 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Trump is furious.

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:19.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
He spent the day yelling
at his staff

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:21.347 align:start size:94% position:6%
and tweeting while
he laid on the couch.

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:24.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
If he's not careful,
he could end up looking like

00:01:24.217 --> 00:01:25.118 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Jabba the Hutt.

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:27.020 line:92%
Now, that was a character.

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:29.389
He loved sitting around all day,
eating snacks,

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:33.226 align:start size:94% position:6%
kind of like someone
who loves Christmas weed.

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:34.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
When you get busted at
the airport

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:35.862 line:92%
for your Christmas cheer,

00:01:35.862 --> 00:01:39.399 align:start size:94% position:6%
your Christmas cheer
turns into Christmas fear.

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:40.500 line:92%
If you're a reporter in Russia

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's what you feel looking
in Putin's eyes.

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:45.004
Ask the wrong question,
and you could go missing.

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:49.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
You could disappear,
just like Jar Jar Binks.

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:50.443 align:start size:94% position:6%
We won't see him
in the new movie

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:51.878 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we won't see
Baby Yoda either.

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:54.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
And when fans find out there's
no little Baby Yoda,

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:56.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
J.J. Abrams
is gonna get impeached.

00:01:56.382 --> 00:02:02.422 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, in conclusion,
may the force be with you.

00:02:02.422 --> 00:02:03.756 line:92%
May the Senate be with you

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:07.160 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Russian accent ]
Don't worry. I'll be with you.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:09.195 size:88% position:44% line:92%
May the 420 be with you.

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:15.735 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:18.271 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Thank you.

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:21.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, guys, today,
the House of Representatives

00:02:21.141 --> 00:02:24.010 align:start size:94% position:6%
officially voted to
impeach President Trump.

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
Of course, it's a dark stain
on his legacy,

00:02:25.879 --> 00:02:28.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
but on the bright side,
Trump finally managed to win

00:02:28.448 --> 00:02:30.383 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
a popular vote.

00:02:30.383 --> 00:02:30.950 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's right.

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:32.986 align:start size:94% position:6%
Trump's allies are worried
about the stain

00:02:32.986 --> 00:02:35.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
that the impeachment
will leave on his legacy.

00:02:35.188 --> 00:02:36.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
Although, when a guy wears
that much spray tan,

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:40.226
I don't think he cares about
the stains he leaves behind.

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:41.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yep, today,
Trump became the third

00:02:41.928 --> 00:02:43.263 line:92%
U.S. president to be impeached

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:47.834 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was Bill Clinton in 1999,
Andrew Johnson in 1868.

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:48.468 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And this is crazy.

00:02:48.468 --> 00:02:51.538 align:start size:94% position:6%
Back in 1868, Andrew Johnson
was also impeached

00:02:51.538 --> 00:02:53.640 align:start size:94% position:6%
for trying to dig up dirt
on Joe Biden.

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.441 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Really?

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:56.910 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, what happened today
is historic,

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:58.478 align:start size:94% position:6%
and experts are saying
that this is what

00:02:58.478 --> 00:03:00.914 line:92%
we'll remember most about 2019

00:03:00.914 --> 00:03:02.248 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then Americans
were like, "Oh, come on.

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:04.717 align:start size:94% position:6%
Have you seen Baby Yoda?
Come on."

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:07.053 align:start size:94% position:6%
But Democrats are saying
that it's a sad day

00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:08.054 line:92%
and that they're in mourning

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:09.589 align:start size:94% position:6%
Some members actually
wore black,

00:03:09.589 --> 00:03:11.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
while, out of respect,
Chuck Schumer

00:03:11.191 --> 00:03:15.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
lowered his glasses
even further down his nose

00:03:18.698 --> 00:03:20.333 size:78% position:39%
Trump sent dozens of
angry tweets all day.

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:23.269
He even tweeted that Democrats
are the ones breaking the law,

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:25.538 align:start size:94% position:6%
writing, "How can they do that
too, and, yet,

00:03:25.538 --> 00:03:28.274 align:start size:94% position:6%
impeach a very successful
economy plus

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:30.643 line:92%
President of the United States?"

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:32.645 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Economy plus?

00:03:32.645 --> 00:03:34.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
You'd think Trump would at
least refer to himself

00:03:34.514 --> 00:03:35.281 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
as business class.

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:38.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And this was everywhere.

00:03:38.585 --> 00:03:40.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Economy.
-[ As Trump ] I'm economy plus

00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:45.491
I'll take an emergency exit row.
There's more leg room.

00:03:45.491 --> 00:03:47.627 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ As Trump ]
I need the tie room."

00:03:47.627 --> 00:03:48.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Normal voice ]
This was everywhere.

00:03:48.661 --> 00:03:50.630 align:start size:94% position:6%
During the debate,
a Republican Congressman

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:52.365 size:88% position:44% line:92%
