00:03:52.365 --> 00:03:52.932 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I don't know.

00:03:52.932 --> 00:03:54.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
If Trump were Jesus, I'm prett
sure we'd have seen him

00:03:54.901 --> 00:03:57.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
