the Democrats,

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:05.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
and pretty much everything
on his mind.

00:04:05.778 --> 00:04:06.813 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, today,
he's even more upset,

00:04:06.813 --> 00:04:11.251 size:78% position:39%
because Nancy Pelosi
just wrote back, "K."

00:04:14.554 --> 00:04:17.190 align:start size:94% position:6%
All day, I saw that
"merry Impeachmas"

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:18.758 size:88% position:44% line:92%
