00:04:23.296 --> 00:04:24.063 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:04:24.063 --> 00:04:25.565 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Meanwhile,
during the impeachment vote,

00:04:25.565 --> 00:04:26.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
